    "detailed_description": "<strong>Where is grandpa?</strong><br><br>Grandpa is still missing and as you delve deeper into the investigation, everything becomes stranger and more enigmatic. Do you dare to unravel all the mysteries?<br><br><strong>About the game:</strong><br><br>If you are a fan of mystery adventures and point &amp; click puzzle games, you can't miss Beach Cafe III: The Escape Room. In this installment of the saga, the laboratory under the beach bar has given way to intricate caves full of surprising vegetation and unknown minerals.<br>If that wasn't enough, it seems that some kind of alien form lives in the convoluted labyrinth? Pay attention, because here... every detail counts!<br><br><strong>Features</strong><br><br>-Explore places full of memories about the stories your grandfather used to tell you.<br>-Progress through different scenarios using logic. Trust your instinct and make decisions, the resolution of this mystery depends on you.<br>-Collect memories that will help you solve the puzzles. A wide variety of suspenseful content awaits you.<br>-Pay attention to your surroundings! This place hides a big secret, but it won't be easy to unravel.<br><br>Can you uncover the mystery of the grottoes and escape? <br><br>Dare to discover this new installment of the Beach Cafe: The Escape Room saga!",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>Where is grandpa?</strong><br><br>Grandpa is still missing and as you delve deeper into the investigation, everything becomes stranger and more enigmatic. Do you dare to unravel all the mysteries?<br><br><strong>About the game:</strong><br><br>If you are a fan of mystery adventures and point &amp; click puzzle games, you can't miss Beach Cafe III: The Escape Room. In this installment of the saga, the laboratory under the beach bar has given way to intricate caves full of surprising vegetation and unknown minerals.<br>If that wasn't enough, it seems that some kind of alien form lives in the convoluted labyrinth? Pay attention, because here... every detail counts!<br><br><strong>Features</strong><br><br>-Explore places full of memories about the stories your grandfather used to tell you.<br>-Progress through different scenarios using logic. Trust your instinct and make decisions, the resolution of this mystery depends on you.<br>-Collect memories that will help you solve the puzzles. A wide variety of suspenseful content awaits you.<br>-Pay attention to your surroundings! This place hides a big secret, but it won't be easy to unravel.<br><br>Can you uncover the mystery of the grottoes and escape? <br><br>Dare to discover this new installment of the Beach Cafe: The Escape Room saga!",
    "short_description": "Grandpa is still missing and as you dive deeper into the investigation, everything becomes stranger and more enigmatic. The adventure of puzzles and mysteries continues with Beach Caf\u00e9 III: The Escape Room. Investigate, discover all the clues and interpret them properly in order to advance.",
